        <item>
            <title>0.18.31</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:14:18 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.18.31</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.18.31</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.18.31</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>New: only with a finger on the trackpad</strong> — a switch in Settings, in the card <strong>Single keys</strong>. When it is on, a single key opens its menu only while a finger rests on the trackpad, so a stray tap while you type opens nothing. Swipe shot and key shot work as before. It is off until you turn it on.</li>
<li><strong>A key shot at a folder looks clean</strong> — tap the key and press a direction toward a folder: the menu now appears complete and the folder opens on it. Before, the menu and the folder grew at the same moment.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
